WEBVTT

00:00:04.790 --> 00:00:06.980
The Replica Ring's ultimate form...

00:00:08.230 --> 00:00:10.860
The Final Ring, has been completed.

00:00:12.170 --> 00:00:15.190
Everything went how
Klondike calculated, huh?

00:00:15.590 --> 00:00:18.990
Now, no one is capable of stopping him.

00:00:22.690 --> 00:00:25.250
Feels like you're up
against the wall, maybe?

00:00:29.270 --> 00:00:33.090
Sure enough, Japan's
apple juice is the best.

00:00:36.320 --> 00:00:38.010
Upperclassman Jikukawa!

00:00:53.280 --> 00:00:54.950
Lost

00:00:54.950 --> 00:00:58.070
Tesaguri de sagashiteta
I've searched, groping

00:00:59.870 --> 00:01:01.990
Tozasareta mirai no kotae nante doko nimo nai
The answer to a future that's been closed off

00:01:01.990 --> 00:01:03.910
Tozasareta mirai no kotae nante doko nimo nai
Is nowhere to be found

00:01:03.910 --> 00:01:07.250
Hashiru shoudou, ima kaidoku funou
The impulse to run, it's impossible to decipher now

00:01:07.250 --> 00:01:08.960
Found

00:01:08.960 --> 00:01:13.210
Kudaketa hazu no unmei o
A fate that was supposedly smashed

00:01:13.210 --> 00:01:17.680
Mijuku na yume no naka de kikoeta kitanda
I've come to hear it within that half-formed dream:

00:01:17.680 --> 00:01:20.510
Saigo made I'll be there for you
Until the end, I'll be there for you

00:01:20.510 --> 00:01:23.600
Tachidomaranai, kono hari dake wa
It won't stop, not this needle

00:01:23.600 --> 00:01:26.940
Boku no asu o kizamu oto o tsukisasu
It will pierce the sound that engraves my tomorrow

00:01:26.940 --> 00:01:28.850
Shinjitsu kara nigetara ima
If I run from the truth, then now...

00:01:28.850 --> 00:01:30.560
Genjitsu ni mo maketara ima
If I lose to reality, then now...

00:01:30.560 --> 00:01:32.900
Nani ga nokoru no?
What will remain?

00:01:32.900 --> 00:01:35.110
(Nokoru no?)
(Will remain?)

00:01:33.940 --> 00:01:37.490
Kazoekirenai kono kizu dake ga
These countless wounds of mine

00:01:37.490 --> 00:01:40.950
Boku no kinou o zanzou to shite kataru
They tell of my yesterday as an afterimage

00:01:40.950 --> 00:01:42.660
Unmei ga hodoketemo ima
Even if fate were unraveled, now...

00:01:42.660 --> 00:01:44.500
Sonzai o kowashitemo ima
Even if my existence were smashed, now...

00:01:44.500 --> 00:01:47.370
Boku no michi o yuku yo
I will travel my path

00:01:47.920 --> 00:01:49.500
It's now or never

00:01:49.500 --> 00:01:50.580
That is what they say

00:01:50.580 --> 00:01:52.670
Live your life today, yeah, yeah

00:01:52.670 --> 00:01:56.340
There will always be,
there will always be a way

00:01:56.340 --> 00:01:57.510
That is what they say

00:01:57.510 --> 00:01:59.680
Live your life today, yeah, yeah

00:01:59.680 --> 00:02:03.180
There will always be,
there will always be a way

00:02:03.180 --> 00:02:04.390
That is what they say

00:02:04.390 --> 00:02:06.810
Live your life today, yeah, yeah

00:02:09.020 --> 00:02:12.980
God's Miscalculation

00:02:16.130 --> 00:02:17.650
Upperclassman Jikukawa!

00:02:18.760 --> 00:02:20.160
I've heard what you've been saying.

00:02:20.890 --> 00:02:22.690
What do you think he wants to do

00:02:22.690 --> 00:02:26.480
with the completed Final
Ring, this Klondike?

00:02:26.480 --> 00:02:27.680
Upperclassman...

00:02:29.070 --> 00:02:30.540
Upperclassman Jikukawa!

00:02:32.560 --> 00:02:35.800
Hey, you been well, Cubik?

00:02:36.900 --> 00:02:39.770
Upperclassman Jikukawa!

00:02:43.450 --> 00:02:45.180
Just where have you been?!

00:02:45.540 --> 00:02:46.950
Cube!

00:02:48.040 --> 00:02:50.190
Well, it ain't hard to see why he's mad.

00:02:50.790 --> 00:02:52.980
Where have you been, Upperclassman?

00:02:53.500 --> 00:02:55.190
Everyone's been worried about you.

00:02:55.400 --> 00:02:59.690
I..I went to Crossfield Academy.

00:02:59.690 --> 00:03:01.570
This is a souvenir from there.

00:03:02.850 --> 00:03:04.070
The heck is that?

00:03:04.910 --> 00:03:06.300
A diary...

00:03:07.050 --> 00:03:09.580
From someone formerly
of the Orpheus Order.

00:03:16.800 --> 00:03:20.090
I found it looking into
Freecell and the others...

00:03:21.600 --> 00:03:25.030
This diary, hidden in
an abandoned cottage.

00:03:26.080 --> 00:03:28.080
I'm impressed you were able to find it.

00:03:29.080 --> 00:03:30.850
Is this enough for you to forgive me?

00:03:33.020 --> 00:03:36.230
So, what's written in that thing?

00:03:36.580 --> 00:03:38.020
The truth...

00:03:38.940 --> 00:03:40.860
About the Replica Rings.

00:03:43.120 --> 00:03:46.630
The Orpheus Order was
formerly a stoic group

00:03:46.630 --> 00:03:50.300
dedicated to freeing
mankind and heightening

00:03:50.300 --> 00:03:52.030
their own mental faculties.

00:03:53.750 --> 00:03:57.570
But when one man entered their ranks,

00:03:57.570 --> 00:03:59.550
things began to go awry.

00:04:00.640 --> 00:04:02.440
He was young, and filled

00:04:02.440 --> 00:04:04.440
with ambitions of obtaining wealth:

00:04:05.310 --> 00:04:07.460
Ludwig Loewenherz.

00:04:08.390 --> 00:04:09.520
Also known as...

00:04:10.320 --> 00:04:11.470
He's Klondike?!

00:04:13.400 --> 00:04:15.780
Since ancient times,

00:04:15.780 --> 00:04:17.830
the unbroken symbol of the Orpheus Order

00:04:17.830 --> 00:04:19.050
has been the Orpheus Ring.

00:04:20.110 --> 00:04:22.340
He knew of its existence,

00:04:22.340 --> 00:04:24.810
and planned to claim it for himself...

00:04:39.380 --> 00:04:42.310
But the Ring refused him.

00:04:43.100 --> 00:04:46.050
And Klondike, determined
to acquire the ultimate intellect,

00:04:46.050 --> 00:04:48.230
began a shocking plan of action.

00:04:52.310 --> 00:04:53.970
I hereby propose that

00:04:53.970 --> 00:04:56.870
we scientifically analyze
the Orpheus Ring

00:04:56.870 --> 00:05:00.440
and begin industrial operations
to mass produce it!

00:05:01.560 --> 00:05:05.230
These "Replica Rings" will
boost the mind's potential!

00:05:05.490 --> 00:05:08.620
Unless that happens,
we shall never change!

00:05:08.620 --> 00:05:10.200
We can change nothing!

00:05:11.170 --> 00:05:13.660
It was such an absurd notion.

00:05:14.250 --> 00:05:17.030
But Klondike had the charisma and

00:05:17.030 --> 00:05:18.500
intellect to sway them all.

00:05:18.880 --> 00:05:24.090
And he possessed the funds
to execute his plan.

00:05:29.270 --> 00:05:31.830
With group sentiment behind him,

00:05:31.830 --> 00:05:34.520
Klondike began analyzing
the Orpheus Ring,

00:05:35.190 --> 00:05:38.230
and completed his first Replica Ring.

00:05:40.900 --> 00:05:44.320
According to the diary,

00:05:44.320 --> 00:05:45.650
the one selected to be

00:05:45.650 --> 00:05:47.660
the first test subject
was a girl named Solitia.

00:05:48.740 --> 00:05:51.080
In order to set humanity free,

00:05:51.080 --> 00:05:53.540
she offered herself
up to accept the Ring.

00:05:55.130 --> 00:05:55.910
However...

00:06:04.840 --> 00:06:09.010
The Replica Ring was
incredibly dangerous.

00:06:10.350 --> 00:06:12.530
She tried several times
to convince the others.

00:06:13.190 --> 00:06:16.270
"This plan using the
Rings is dangerous."

00:06:16.900 --> 00:06:21.820
But the Orpheus Order was
already under Klondike's control.

00:06:21.820 --> 00:06:25.780
No one would pay any
heed to what she said.

00:06:26.740 --> 00:06:28.960
Sensing danger, Solitia

00:06:28.960 --> 00:06:31.030
escaped the Orpheus Order....

00:06:32.080 --> 00:06:34.870
With the Ring, unable to
be removed, still on her.

00:06:34.870 --> 00:06:37.110
And with a young Freecell.

00:06:40.840 --> 00:06:42.670
Freecell?!

00:06:43.050 --> 00:06:45.240
Sheeit! So that's it?

00:06:46.050 --> 00:06:48.300
It can't be; Solitia was...

00:06:48.740 --> 00:06:51.380
Yes, she was his mother.

00:06:53.020 --> 00:06:55.580
The Replica Ring's first sacrifice...

00:06:56.160 --> 00:06:58.560
was none other than Freecell's mother.

00:07:01.190 --> 00:07:02.650
For real?

00:07:03.360 --> 00:07:05.110
Solitia successfully escaped,

00:07:05.110 --> 00:07:07.260
and settled somewhere far away.

00:07:09.660 --> 00:07:12.220
At last, her days had become peaceful.

00:07:13.290 --> 00:07:16.060
But they didn't last long.

00:07:17.540 --> 00:07:23.000
Her mind had already become
twisted by the Ring.

00:07:32.140 --> 00:07:35.180
I am in the midst of anguish.

00:07:36.310 --> 00:07:38.850
Happiness fairly brimming with light,

00:07:38.850 --> 00:07:41.190
and malice as if blown from
the depths of the earth...

00:07:42.570 --> 00:07:45.150
I am buffeted by a wave of emotions

00:07:45.150 --> 00:07:46.980
that drives me between the two.

00:07:49.320 --> 00:07:51.660
I love Freecell,

00:07:51.660 --> 00:07:53.410
and yet in the next moment,

00:07:53.410 --> 00:07:55.450
I find myself loathing him.

00:07:56.370 --> 00:08:00.480
Why am I unable to smile at him?

00:08:01.590 --> 00:08:03.940
Always and forever...

00:08:06.720 --> 00:08:09.440
Such sad words.

00:08:10.260 --> 00:08:12.970
It's like Freecell said.

00:08:14.180 --> 00:08:16.680
His kind mother was a fake memory.

00:08:18.190 --> 00:08:20.490
The cold mother was the real one,

00:08:20.490 --> 00:08:22.600
and he hated her.

00:08:23.940 --> 00:08:26.880
But both memories were true.

00:08:28.200 --> 00:08:29.590
His mother had just

00:08:29.590 --> 00:08:32.190
been swallowed up by the Replica Ring.

00:08:34.250 --> 00:08:35.870
This diary...

00:08:35.870 --> 00:08:37.990
It's repentance for her sins.

00:08:38.290 --> 00:08:39.160
Yeah.

00:08:40.080 --> 00:08:45.120
But Solitia died before she
could entrust it to Freecell.

00:08:47.340 --> 00:08:49.820
What a cruel turn of fate:

00:08:50.630 --> 00:08:54.050
For the son to wear a Replica Ring,

00:08:54.050 --> 00:08:56.260
the thing that twisted his mother.

00:08:56.720 --> 00:08:58.350
What's more,

00:08:58.350 --> 00:09:00.910
it was all an experiment
devised by Klondike

00:09:00.910 --> 00:09:03.390
in order to complete the Final Ring.

00:09:04.440 --> 00:09:07.650
Freecell was the same as me?

00:09:08.650 --> 00:09:11.730
He got drawn into the
motives of grownups...

00:09:12.240 --> 00:09:14.480
and lost his parents!

00:09:16.450 --> 00:09:17.530
Kaito...

00:09:19.000 --> 00:09:20.770
The fate that has enveloped Freecell,

00:09:20.770 --> 00:09:23.290
Solitia and the Replica Rings

00:09:23.290 --> 00:09:25.590
is a twisted, difficult puzzle.

00:09:29.470 --> 00:09:33.430
The one person who can solve
it and set him free...

00:09:33.970 --> 00:09:36.050
is you, Kaito, only you.

00:09:37.060 --> 00:09:39.540
You who made that promise to him.

00:09:41.980 --> 00:09:43.830
Yeah, you're right.

00:09:45.110 --> 00:09:46.860
I gotta help him!

00:09:47.320 --> 00:09:50.190
Set him free from that puzzle of fate!

00:09:51.240 --> 00:09:52.070
Kaito!

00:09:53.580 --> 00:09:55.690
There's no puzzle I can't solve!

00:09:57.910 --> 00:09:58.950
Yes!

00:09:59.240 --> 00:10:03.420
But Klondike has captured Freecell.

00:10:03.420 --> 00:10:04.330
What will you do?

00:10:08.210 --> 00:10:09.580
There is a way.

00:10:10.380 --> 00:10:11.260
Rook!

00:10:11.670 --> 00:10:15.040
Destroy the Final Ring
and stop Klondike.

00:10:15.720 --> 00:10:18.840
Do that, and you can save Freecell.

00:10:19.680 --> 00:10:21.100
Stop Klondike?!

00:10:21.430 --> 00:10:24.770
Yes, the plan is already in motion.

00:10:24.770 --> 00:10:25.600
The hell?

00:10:25.900 --> 00:10:27.160
What's this plan of yours?

00:10:28.230 --> 00:10:30.780
The POG has asked for help.

00:10:31.240 --> 00:10:33.350
They want to thwart Klondike's ambitions

00:10:33.350 --> 00:10:35.570
and free Freecell.

00:10:35.570 --> 00:10:39.720
However, there's only so much
two high schoolers can do.

00:10:40.660 --> 00:10:42.530
You are under no obligation to help,

00:10:43.080 --> 00:10:45.870
but we would ask that you assist us...

00:10:45.870 --> 00:10:47.750
All of us.

00:10:53.300 --> 00:10:55.010
Well, shall we begin?

00:10:55.550 --> 00:10:56.270
Yeah.

00:11:09.650 --> 00:11:11.230
At last, it's finished...

00:11:12.110 --> 00:11:14.400
The Final Ring!

00:11:14.400 --> 00:11:16.710
Uncle, where will you begin?

00:11:17.360 --> 00:11:20.370
First, shall we test
the power of this Ring?

00:11:20.370 --> 00:11:22.130
You gonna take over the world?

00:11:22.830 --> 00:11:27.890
Not bad, but I could do that anytime.

00:11:28.580 --> 00:11:32.420
I want to try something
even more elaborate.

00:11:33.010 --> 00:11:36.550
For example, creating a new universe!

00:11:36.550 --> 00:11:38.670
Wow, that's great!

00:11:39.090 --> 00:11:40.250
Oh, Uncle!

00:11:40.720 --> 00:11:42.430
No you don't.

00:11:43.140 --> 00:11:45.300
We're going to destroy that Ring.

00:11:45.850 --> 00:11:47.520
Oh my, that voice.

00:11:47.520 --> 00:11:49.430
It's Pinochle, Mr. Relieved of Duty.

00:11:49.900 --> 00:11:52.940
You all think you can
actually do something?

00:11:53.110 --> 00:11:56.070
I know my limitations.

00:11:56.070 --> 00:11:56.650
So...

00:11:58.740 --> 00:12:01.740
I'm grateful to you all, POG.

00:12:04.910 --> 00:12:06.710
We may be sister schools,

00:12:06.710 --> 00:12:09.080
but answering the students' wishes...

00:12:11.160 --> 00:12:14.330
is a principal's job.

00:12:15.130 --> 00:12:17.680
The Final Ring's completion

00:12:17.680 --> 00:12:20.840
is a situation we cannot overlook.

00:12:21.350 --> 00:12:24.310
I never imagined the POG and the

00:12:24.310 --> 00:12:26.470
Orpheus Order would fight side by side.

00:12:26.850 --> 00:12:29.350
Gets you fired up, huh? For real.

00:12:30.190 --> 00:12:31.350
Let's begin.

00:12:31.770 --> 00:12:33.510
I challenge you, Klondike!

00:12:33.820 --> 00:12:35.400
Let's play up.

00:12:38.690 --> 00:12:39.360
A fire?!

00:12:39.740 --> 00:12:42.600
The building's systems
have been hacked and

00:12:42.600 --> 00:12:44.970
are sending out spurious information.

00:12:44.970 --> 00:12:47.200
This building's security is perfect,

00:12:47.540 --> 00:12:49.330
unable to be broken by
one such as Pinochle.

00:12:51.010 --> 00:12:52.470
He has enlisted help...

00:12:52.920 --> 00:12:54.000
from the POG.

00:12:54.340 --> 00:12:55.750
The POG?

00:12:55.750 --> 00:13:00.500
They plan to capture me and
destroy the Final Ring.

00:13:01.600 --> 00:13:02.760
A good opportunity.

00:13:04.120 --> 00:13:07.220
I shall prove the Ring lets
me predict the future,

00:13:08.000 --> 00:13:10.760
and the accuracy of its power.

00:13:13.940 --> 00:13:17.430
He plans to escape via the
heliport on the top floor.

00:13:17.990 --> 00:13:20.280
There are a total of eight elevators.

00:13:20.280 --> 00:13:22.920
I'm gonna shut them all
down, leaving him trapped.

00:13:23.740 --> 00:13:26.030
You're not getting away, Klondike!

00:13:29.580 --> 00:13:32.290
The target has begun
moving via elevator.

00:13:33.080 --> 00:13:35.870
Access the elevator system.

00:13:40.340 --> 00:13:40.920
This is...

00:13:41.880 --> 00:13:45.550
All the elevators operate
on independent systems!

00:13:45.760 --> 00:13:49.430
So, we have to gain control
of them one at a time?!

00:13:49.770 --> 00:13:51.430
It's our only option.

00:13:51.690 --> 00:13:53.180
Start hacking!

00:13:57.900 --> 00:13:59.190
Hacking complete in...

00:14:01.240 --> 00:14:02.280
5...

00:14:02.280 --> 00:14:03.320
4...

00:14:03.320 --> 00:14:04.360
3...

00:14:04.360 --> 00:14:05.370
2...

00:14:05.370 --> 00:14:06.420
1!

00:14:07.830 --> 00:14:10.020
A few seconds later and

00:14:10.020 --> 00:14:11.950
we would have been trapped.

00:14:17.090 --> 00:14:19.660
He got off right before
we stopped the elevator.

00:14:20.420 --> 00:14:21.640
Just as we'd planned.

00:14:22.090 --> 00:14:24.210
Hurry and hack the next elevator!

00:14:24.420 --> 00:14:25.840
Already doing it!

00:14:40.190 --> 00:14:41.360
So close!

00:14:41.940 --> 00:14:43.970
Found you, Klondike!

00:14:45.240 --> 00:14:47.240
Oh, Doubt, you too?

00:14:47.990 --> 00:14:50.830
The cause of the Orpheus Order

00:14:50.830 --> 00:14:52.310
was to elevate ourselves,

00:14:52.310 --> 00:14:54.620
strive for mankind's further growth.

00:14:55.250 --> 00:14:58.970
You used us, disgraced us, brought us

00:14:58.970 --> 00:15:00.540
to ruin for your own greed,

00:15:00.540 --> 00:15:01.730
and so you and that Ring...

00:15:02.420 --> 00:15:03.750
I cannot forgive them!

00:15:04.170 --> 00:15:06.720
Mr. Klondike, please leave this to us.

00:15:07.180 --> 00:15:08.220
Sure.

00:15:09.190 --> 00:15:09.970
Wait!

00:15:15.560 --> 00:15:16.390
Don't let him get away!

00:15:20.440 --> 00:15:23.060
Doubt has begun running
on the 21st floor.

00:15:23.990 --> 00:15:25.650
How you doing over there, Diceman?

00:15:25.860 --> 00:15:28.650
Just a little longer, be done in...

00:15:29.120 --> 00:15:30.280
3...

00:15:30.280 --> 00:15:31.450
2...

00:15:31.450 --> 00:15:32.280
1!

00:15:33.370 --> 00:15:34.240
What?!

00:15:36.670 --> 00:15:38.940
We've pared down Klondike's crew.

00:15:39.420 --> 00:15:40.760
Heading to the next point.

00:15:45.840 --> 00:15:48.420
Klondike is headed for
the seventh elevator.

00:15:49.080 --> 00:15:50.630
Just as we'd planned, huh?

00:15:51.180 --> 00:15:53.970
Yes, but something's strange.

00:15:53.970 --> 00:15:55.050
Exactly.

00:15:56.190 --> 00:15:58.050
Klondike's movements are

00:15:58.050 --> 00:16:00.890
always one second ahead of ours.

00:16:01.110 --> 00:16:05.270
It may be Klondike for whom
things are just as planned.

00:16:05.940 --> 00:16:08.650
You mean he's figured
out our entire plan?!

00:16:09.450 --> 00:16:13.810
So this is the Final Ring, eh?

00:16:15.290 --> 00:16:18.410
Klondike has moved to the last elevator.

00:16:21.750 --> 00:16:24.250
He will reach the top floor.

00:16:24.460 --> 00:16:25.960
No, I won't let him!

00:16:31.010 --> 00:16:33.390
Has the elevator system
been compromised?

00:16:33.930 --> 00:16:36.260
The POG are kinda good, huh?

00:16:42.860 --> 00:16:43.600
That's...

00:16:44.360 --> 00:16:46.560
A maze using the fire doors.

00:16:47.780 --> 00:16:49.700
It seems that to reach the top floor,

00:16:49.700 --> 00:16:52.110
we must go through this maze.

00:16:52.670 --> 00:16:55.160
Yes, precisely.

00:16:56.910 --> 00:16:59.620
Klondike has entered the
maze on the 59th floor.

00:16:59.920 --> 00:17:00.810
Got it!

00:17:03.000 --> 00:17:05.120
Not much longer and I'll get you...

00:17:05.500 --> 00:17:07.290
at the ideal point!

00:17:08.840 --> 00:17:11.950
Klondike's executive office
on the 59th floor...

00:17:12.550 --> 00:17:14.390
There are no other exits or entrances.

00:17:14.390 --> 00:17:16.970
If I can trap them here
on the top floor...

00:17:17.720 --> 00:17:19.570
they'll have nowhere to run to!

00:17:22.900 --> 00:17:25.360
This is your executive office, Uncle?

00:17:25.360 --> 00:17:27.860
It would seem that we were led here.

00:17:28.240 --> 00:17:29.610
That's right.

00:17:30.700 --> 00:17:33.910
Hand it over, please, the Final Ring.

00:17:33.910 --> 00:17:36.490
And Freecell too.

00:17:37.240 --> 00:17:37.990
Well...

00:17:38.750 --> 00:17:40.160
Give it up!

00:17:40.160 --> 00:17:41.990
There's nowhere you can run.

00:17:42.440 --> 00:17:45.340
If you pin me in here, you can win.

00:17:45.980 --> 00:17:48.800
It would seem that is your thinking.

00:17:48.800 --> 00:17:52.380
But are you aware that I
have this sort of system?

00:17:55.510 --> 00:17:58.600
This room is rigged so
that in an emergency,

00:17:58.600 --> 00:18:01.640
I can go directly to the top floor.

00:18:02.720 --> 00:18:05.530
In trying to capture me,

00:18:05.530 --> 00:18:08.020
you in fact led me to my goal.

00:18:08.320 --> 00:18:10.770
Th..That's impossible!

00:18:12.030 --> 00:18:13.280
My, such unsightly faces.

00:18:15.200 --> 00:18:16.530
I thank you.

00:18:17.120 --> 00:18:19.570
This has proven that my ability

00:18:19.570 --> 00:18:22.340
to predict the future is 100% accurate.

00:18:23.040 --> 00:18:25.690
Klondike!

00:18:33.180 --> 00:18:36.300
I should be grateful
to Doubt and Pinochle.

00:18:37.140 --> 00:18:39.680
Thanks to the commotion they caused,

00:18:40.280 --> 00:18:42.810
I made it here without difficulty.

00:18:43.350 --> 00:18:45.810
Sure enough, you came, Freecell.

00:18:47.070 --> 00:18:48.560
This was in your calculations too?

00:18:48.730 --> 00:18:51.940
Of course, and what
happens next as well.

00:18:53.120 --> 00:18:55.070
You want this Ring, don't you?

00:18:57.490 --> 00:19:00.870
However, do you think you can defeat me?

00:19:01.660 --> 00:19:04.830
I who have achieved power equal to God?

00:19:07.130 --> 00:19:08.460
Very well,

00:19:08.460 --> 00:19:11.500
then let us challenge each other
as opponents in a game.

00:19:15.260 --> 00:19:17.950
This is the Straying Field?

00:19:22.310 --> 00:19:23.310
What's going on?

00:19:23.310 --> 00:19:24.600
On its own, the Ring...

00:19:25.230 --> 00:19:27.030
They're resonating.

00:19:27.650 --> 00:19:29.670
Mr. Klondike's Final Ring...

00:19:30.320 --> 00:19:32.690
Miss Melancholy's Orpheus Ring...

00:19:32.690 --> 00:19:36.610
And Mr. Freecell's Replica Ring...

00:19:38.030 --> 00:19:41.360
In the end, whose Ring shall remain?

00:19:41.950 --> 00:19:43.120
Whist...

00:19:43.290 --> 00:19:46.590
You couldn't predict his betrayal.

00:19:47.540 --> 00:19:48.920
I guess it's only natural.

00:19:48.920 --> 00:19:52.120
From here on, it's the
future that I've seen.

00:19:53.380 --> 00:19:55.810
I see, interesting.

00:19:56.760 --> 00:19:58.510
Then, let us make certain:

00:19:58.800 --> 00:20:03.270
Which future is correct, yours or mine?

00:20:05.810 --> 00:20:07.510
There's no need.

00:20:07.770 --> 00:20:10.770
Hey, the game hasn't started yet!

00:20:11.610 --> 00:20:13.940
I have no intention of playing with you.

00:20:14.280 --> 00:20:16.190
My opponent in the game...

00:20:17.700 --> 00:20:19.400
will be Kaito, no one else.

00:20:20.570 --> 00:20:22.320
Th..That eye!

00:20:28.370 --> 00:20:32.000
That eye was scary.

00:20:33.050 --> 00:20:35.260
Like it would swallow everything up...

00:20:36.470 --> 00:20:38.090
That eye!

00:20:38.510 --> 00:20:40.340
No, stay back!

00:20:41.720 --> 00:20:43.390
Do you want this Ring?

00:20:43.390 --> 00:20:44.890
I'll give it to you!

00:20:44.890 --> 00:20:47.350
I'll give it, just stay back!

00:20:47.770 --> 00:20:51.100
Melancholy, you're saying you'll
abandon the Orpheus Ring?!

00:20:51.480 --> 00:20:54.020
I mean, this thing just
attached itself to me!

00:20:54.020 --> 00:20:55.980
Uncle, hurry and take it off!

00:20:55.980 --> 00:20:57.610
Otherwise, this monster will...

00:21:01.930 --> 00:21:04.560
No, I don't need this thing anymore!

00:21:12.750 --> 00:21:14.010
Useless.

00:21:17.010 --> 00:21:19.920
I'll correct an error like
this with the Final Ring!

00:21:33.610 --> 00:21:36.480
All electrical power in the Foundation's
main building has shut down.

00:21:36.480 --> 00:21:38.440
All access has been cut off.

00:21:39.300 --> 00:21:40.730
What's happened?!

00:21:40.990 --> 00:21:42.360
Understood.

00:21:42.360 --> 00:21:44.820
I ask that you please
gather more information.

00:21:45.630 --> 00:21:47.290
Is something going on?

00:21:47.290 --> 00:21:48.240
Well...

00:21:51.750 --> 00:21:52.750
Hello?

00:21:52.750 --> 00:21:54.790
Kaito? It's me, Pinochle.

00:21:54.920 --> 00:21:55.920
Pinochle?

00:21:55.920 --> 00:21:57.620
Dude, are you okay?

00:21:57.920 --> 00:22:00.090
I have a message from Freecell.

00:22:00.090 --> 00:22:01.000
From Freecell?

00:22:02.440 --> 00:22:03.970
You saw Freecell?

00:22:03.970 --> 00:22:05.510
Is he all right?!

00:22:08.680 --> 00:22:11.760
Yeah, Freecell is all right.

00:22:15.020 --> 00:22:17.100
This is Freecell's message:

00:22:18.440 --> 00:22:21.980
"Kaito, I'm waiting for
you at the Puzzle of God."

00:22:23.190 --> 00:22:24.490
The Puzzle of God?!

00:22:38.710 --> 00:22:40.050
Eiyuukidori
Playing the hero

00:22:40.050 --> 00:22:44.940
Itsudatte shinjita muteki no kankaku
A sense of invincibility you always believed in

00:22:45.550 --> 00:22:51.370
Tatakatte iru no wa chikyuu no tame nanka ja nai
You're not fighting for the sake of the world or anything

00:22:51.370 --> 00:22:54.160
Motto maipeesu de
It's for a more leisurely

00:22:54.160 --> 00:22:59.230
Sou, motto shoujiki na onegai no tame
Yeah, more straightforward request

00:22:59.600 --> 00:23:07.670
Nandotonaku kizutsuitemo tachiagare, hero
Even if you're wounded over and over, rise up, hero

00:23:07.670 --> 00:23:13.220
Kitto daijoubu, kimi o mamorunda
It's sure to be all right, I'll protect you

00:23:13.610 --> 00:23:17.040
Machigai da to shitemo tomarenai
Even if it's wrong, it can't be stopped

00:23:17.040 --> 00:23:20.650
Seikai ka nante wakaranai
I don't know if it's the right answer

00:23:21.550 --> 00:23:24.660
Donna toki demo original ni
No matter the situation

00:23:24.660 --> 00:23:27.400
Step o fumidashiteku
I'll take those first steps, originally

00:23:27.400 --> 00:23:30.770
Dramatic ni, mawaru sekai de
On this spinning world, I'm searching, dramatically

00:23:30.770 --> 00:23:34.430
Kiwameita wonder sagashiteru
For wonders that sparkle

00:23:35.190 --> 00:23:38.430
Boku, shijou saikou no tabi o tsuzukeyou
Me, I'll keep going on the greatest journey in history

00:23:38.430 --> 00:23:42.740
Image shite shiawase na mirai e
To the happy future I imagined

00:23:44.430 --> 00:23:46.060
Mirai e
To the future

00:23:47.920 --> 00:23:51.380
Mirai e
To the future

00:23:51.380 --> 00:23:52.800
Mirai e
To the future

00:23:54.710 --> 00:23:56.260
(Mirai e)
(To the future)

00:24:02.250 --> 00:24:03.340
Damn you, Whist!

00:24:03.380 --> 00:24:05.210
Taking Nonoha Itou hostage to

00:24:05.210 --> 00:24:07.680
draw Kaito Daimon out is playin' dirty!

00:24:07.680 --> 00:24:10.640
It seems the place for the final battle
is the Himalayas, huh?

00:24:10.640 --> 00:24:11.720
Himalayas...

00:24:11.720 --> 00:24:12.810
Those frozen mountains?!

00:24:12.810 --> 00:24:13.970
Only two episodes left.

00:24:13.970 --> 00:24:15.180
Can we climb them in time?

00:24:15.180 --> 00:24:15.850
Huh?

00:24:15.850 --> 00:24:17.180
Get ready at once!

00:24:17.180 --> 00:24:19.180
Next time, "The Closed-Off World"

00:24:18.410 --> 00:24:26.630
The Closed-Off World

00:24:19.180 --> 00:24:20.810
Make sure you're protected
against the cold.

00:24:21.360 --> 00:24:22.940
Don't throw trash on the mountains!

00:24:22.940 --> 00:24:24.610
Are we really climbing them?!
